# Python — OFFLINE FALLBACK ONLY
# Primary source: GitHub Python.gitignore (fetched at setup time)
# This file is used only when the network is unavailable during setup-init.
# Added once by setup-init — edit freely, not managed or overwritten by gitignore-sync.

